# ============================================================
# navois-contracts — Hardhat workspace
#
# Only the contracts, the deploy script and this config belong
# in history. `npx hardhat compile` re-creates artifacts/ and
# cache/ byte for byte, and node_modules/ is 200+ MB of
# dependency that `npm install` restores — so none of them is
# tracked, the same rule the repository root .gitignore applies.
# ============================================================

# ---------- dependencies ----------
node_modules/

# ---------- compiler output (regenerated by `hardhat compile`) ----------
artifacts/
cache/
typechain-types/

# ---------- coverage ----------
coverage/
coverage.json

# ---------- local configuration and secrets ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---------- runtime state ----------
*.log
